    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only racing game where you're driving real cars\u2014remotely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Hura GP, a one-of-a-kind motorsport experience where the speed is real, the cars are physical, and the arena is digitally powered. Take control of electric racing machines using a pro esports steering wheel and go head-to-head with other players in a fast-paced, competitive environment that blurs the line between gaming and reality.This isn\u2019t a simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the real world \u2014 turned into a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Real Electric Cars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Remotely control high-performance, real-world vehicles designed for racing arenas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Steering Wheel Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Feel every turn and drift using your favorite racing wheel setup.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Compete in live races against other drivers, whether you're on-site or watching and playing remotely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-First Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0No rubberbanding, no assists \u2014 just pure driving skill and razor-sharp reflexes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only racing game where you're driving real cars\u2014remotely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Hura GP, a one-of-a-kind motorsport experience where the speed is real, the cars are physical, and the arena is digitally powered. Take control of electric racing machines using a pro esports steering wheel and go head-to-head with other players in a fast-paced, competitive environment that blurs the line between gaming and reality.This isn\u2019t a simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the real world \u2014 turned into a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Real Electric Cars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Remotely control high-performance, real-world vehicles designed for racing arenas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Steering Wheel Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Feel every turn and drift using your favorite racing wheel setup.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Compete in live races against other drivers, whether you're on-site or watching and playing remotely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-First Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0No rubberbanding, no assists \u2014 just pure driving skill and razor-sharp reflexes.</p>",
